;; expect: main.keep.hole_1 hole [(A : (Sort 1)) (x : A) (xs : (List A)) ⊢ A]
;; a hole over a type parameter: the parameter is handed first. K's opaque kind wants a value of
;; the hole's type to stand for it, and a type parameter has no default: the name in scope of
;; that type is one
(fn keep ((A Type) (x A) (xs (List A))) A (hole))
